md"},"id":"call_02_N4gMMdtuHX3jzl8fMb930643","name":"read_file","type":"toolCall"}],"created_at":"2026-01-15T08:00:00.000Z","execution_id":"evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:execution:1","message_id":"evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:message:2","message_kind":"model_response","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","outcome_status":"completed","provider":"deepseek","response_id":"5c604d81-c255-4fe3-ab47-786b1f99830d","session_id":"session:893ce52e-fadc-4212-848a-ec6a31bdffaa","stop_reason":"toolUse","usage":{"cacheRead":640,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0.000001792,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0.00032536,"output":0.000036400000000000004,"total":0.00036355200000000006},"input":2324,"output":130,"reasoning":14,"totalTokens":3094}},"type":"message"},{"attachments":[],"entry":{"created_at":"2026-01-15T08:00:00.000Z","entry_id":"message:evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:message:3","entry_type":"message","message_id":"evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:message:3","parent_entry_id":"message:evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:message:2","session_id":"session:893ce52e-fadc-4212-848a-ec6a31bdffaa"},"message":{"completed_at":"2026-01-15T08:00:00.000Z","content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"project/feature-brief.md\",\n  \"content\": \"# 功能目标\\n\\n为本地桌面应用新增可恢复的后台导入任务。用户可发起导入、查看进度、取消任务，并在重启后继续查看最终结果。\\n\",\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"bytesReturned\": 173,\n  \"sizeBytes\": 173,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","type":"text"}],"created_at":"2026-01-15T08:00:00.000Z","execution_id":"evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:execution:1","message_id":"evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:message:3","message_kind":"tool_result","session_id":"session:893ce52e-fadc-4212-848a-ec6a31bdffaa","status":"success","tool_call_id":"call_00_fvMFvc4QcIfoD287DLF30103","tool_name":"read_file"},"type":"message"},{"attachments":[],"entry":{"created_at":"2026-01-15T08:00:00.000Z","entry_id":"message:evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:message:4","entry_type":"message","message_id":"evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:message:4","parent_entry_id":"message:evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:message:3","session_id":"session:893ce52e-fadc-4212-848a-ec6a31bdffaa"},"message":{"completed_at":"2026-01-15T08:00:00.000Z","content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"project/architecture.md\",\n  \"content\": \"# 当前架构\\n\\nRenderer 只调用 IPC Contract；Main Host 负责进程能力；Product Owner 保存业务状态；Runtime Event 只传递瞬时进度，数据库保存最终任务事实。\\n\",\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"bytesReturned\": 191,\n  \"sizeBytes\": 191,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","type":"text"}],"created_at":"2026-01-15T08:00:00.000Z","execution_id":"evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:execution:1","message_id":"evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:message:4","message_kind":"tool_result","session_id":"session:893ce52e-fadc-4212-848a-ec6a31bdffaa","status":"success","tool_call_id":"call_01_rMalX14ORWmEIsgZzdFC1343","tool_name":"read_file"},"type":"message"},{"attachments":[],"entry":{"created_at":"2026-01-15T08:00:00.000Z","entry_id":"message:evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:message:5","entry_type":"message","message_id":"evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:message:5","parent_entry_id":"message:evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:message:4","session_id":"session:893ce52e-fadc-4212-848a-ec6a31bdffaa"},"message":{"completed_at":"2026-01-15T08:00:00.000Z","content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"project/constraints.md\",\n  \"content\": \"# 约束\\n\\n不得让 Runtime Event 成为最终业务状态；取消必须幂等；失败不能阻止应用启动；本次不实现云同步；验证不包含打包。\\n\",\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"bytesReturned\": 167,\n  \"sizeBytes\": 167,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","type":"text"}],"created_at":"2026-01-15T08:00:00.000Z","execution_id":"evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:execution:1","message_id":"evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:message:5","message_kind":"tool_result","session_id":"session:893ce52e-fadc-4212-848a-ec6a31bdffaa","status":"success","tool_call_id":"call_02_N4gMMdtuHX3jzl8fMb930643","tool_name":"read_file"},"type":"message"},{"attachments":[],"entry":{"created_at":"2026-01-15T08:00:00.000Z","entry_id":"message:evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:message:6","entry_type":"message","message_id":"evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:message:6","parent_entry_id":"message:evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:message:5","session_id":"session:893ce52e-fadc-4212-848a-ec6a31bdffaa"},"message":{"api":"openai-completions","completed_at":"2026-01-15T08:00:00.000Z","content":[{"thinking":"Let me understand the project files:\n\n1. **feature-brief.md**: Goal — add recoverable background import tasks to a local desktop app. Users can initiate imports, view progress, cancel tasks, and continue viewing final results after restart.\n\n2. **architecture.md**: Current architecture:\n   - Renderer only calls IPC Contract\n   - Main Host handles process capabilities\n   - Product Owner saves business state\n   - Runtime Event only passes transient progress; database saves final task facts\n\n3. **constraints.md**: Constraints:\n   - Runtime Event must not become final business state\n   - Cancellation must be idempotent\n   - Failure must not prevent app startup\n   - No cloud sync this time\n   - Verification does not include packaging\n\nNow I need to create:\n- `delivery/implementation-plan.md` — plan broken into tasks by dependency order, explaining module responsibilities and verification\n- `delivery/risk-checklist.md` — risk list with risk, impact, mitigation, and verification method\n\nLet me first check if the delivery directory exists. Then write the two files.\n\nLet me create the plan. I should think carefully about the domain:\n\n- Renderer (UI): initiate import, show progress, cancel, view results after restart\n- IPC Contract: defined API between renderer and main\n- Main Host: process capability (file access, background worker, lifecycle)\n- Product Owner: business state persistence (database = final task facts)\n- Runtime Event: transient progress only (not persisted as final state)\n\nImplementation plan by dependency order:\n\n1. **IPC Contract 定义** — define contract (initiateImport, getImportTask, cancelImport, subscribeProgress). No dependencies. Verification: contract types compile / contract tests.\n\n2. **Product Owner 数据模型与持久化** — task records (id, status, progress fields not final state but facts: submitted, running, cancelled, failed, completed; result location), DB schema, repository. Depends on contract for task DTO shape. Verification: unit tests for repo round-trip; restart persistence test.\n\n3. **Main Host 导入执行器（后台任务）** — background import worker, chunked processing, progress emission via Runtime Event, checkpoint persistence. Depends on Product Owner persistence (write facts) and contract (progress event shape). Verification: integration test with fixture file; progress events observed.\n\n4. **取消机制（幂等）** — cancel command handling: idempotent state transition, cancellation flag checked between chunks, concurrent cancel safe. Depends on executor + persistence. Verification: repeated cancel calls produce same final state; no partial results marked complete.\n\n5. **启动恢复** — on startup, Main Host scans DB for running tasks, marks interrupted ones as failed (or resumes), app starts despite failures. Depends on persistence + executor. Verification: simulated crash, restart, task shows terminal state, app boots.\n\n6. **Renderer 集成** — UI calls IPC, subscribes to progress, displays results; error paths. Depends on contract + executor + recovery. Verification: end-to-end manual/automated UI test.\n\n7. **验证与验收** — run verification suite (no packaging per constraints). Depends on all.\n\nModule responsibilities:\n- Renderer: view + user interaction only, no business logic\n- IPC Contract: typed interface between processes\n- Main Host: process lifecycle, background execution, cancellation enforcement\n- Product Owner: task state machine, persistence of final facts\n- Runtime Event: transient progress channel only\n\nRisk checklist:\n1. Runtime Event 被当作最终状态 → 影响：重启后状态丢失/不一致 → 缓解：仅数据库为事实来源，事件仅瞬时 → 验证：重启后校验 DB 状态与事件无关\n2. 取消竞态（取消与完成同时发生）→ 影响：结果状态错误 → 缓解：状态机原子转换 + 幂等取消 → 验证：并发/重复取消测试\n3. 崩溃时任务悬在 running → 影响：重启后假\"运行中\" → 缓解：启动时恢复扫描，标记中断任务 → 验证：模拟崩溃重启测试\n4. 导入失败阻止应用启动 → 影响：应用不可用 → 缓解：恢复逻辑 try/catch 隔离，失败仅影响任务状态 → 验证：注入失败，确认启动成功\n5. 进度事件积压/顺序乱 → 影响：UI 进度错乱 → 缓解：事件携带任务 ID 与版本/序号，UI 只读展示 → 验证：压力测试事件顺序\n6. 数据库写入与事件不一致 → 影响：用户看到进度与实际不符 → 缓解：先写事实再发事件，事件仅提示刷新 → 验证：核对 DB 与事件序列\n7. 重复导入/并发任务冲突 → 影响：资源竞争 → 缓解：任务 ID 唯一、队列串行或分片锁 → 验证：并发发起测试\n8. 结果文件损坏/不完整 → 影响：导入结果错误 → 缓解：校验和/行数校验，失败标记 → 验证：坏文件注入测试\n9. 大文件导入导致主进程阻塞 → 影响：UI 卡顿 → 缓解：分块异步执行，进度节流 → 验证：大文件基准测试\n10. 升级/迁移导致数据库 schema 变化 → 影响：旧数据不可读 → 缓解：schema 版本化，迁移脚本 → 验证：迁移测试\n\nLet me check the workspace structure first to see what exists, then create the delivery directory and files.\n\nActually, let me check the directory structure quickly to see if there's a delivery dir already.","type":"thinking"},{"arguments":{"path":"."},"id":"call_00_xof4nxXlFz0bXFN5kXmc0237","name":"list_directory","type":"toolCall"}],"created_at":"2026-01-15T08:00:00.000Z","execution_id":"evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:execution:1","message_id":"evaluation:conversation.plan-and-review-delivery:message:6","message_kind":"model_response","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","outcome_status":"completed","provider":"deepseek","response_id":"b4722126-eb52-4041-9dfa-fd831c17d0c6","session_id":"session:893ce52e-fadc-4212-848a-ec6a31bdffaa","stop_reason":"toolUse","usage":{"cacheRead":2944,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0.0000082432,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0.000060060000000000004,"output":0.00034216000000000004,"total":0.0004104632000000001},"input":429,"output":1222,"reasoning":1179,"totalTokens":4595}},"type":"message"},{"attachments":[],"entry":{"created_at":"2026-01-15T08:00:00.000Z","entry_id":"message:evaluation:conver